{
  "slug": "keep-awake",
  "name": "Keep Awake",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prevents your computer from sleeping while Claude Code is working. Cross-platform support for macOS, Linux, and Windows. Activates automatically on prompt submission and tool use, auto-expires after 30 minutes of inactivity, and cleans up on session end — no orphaned processes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (5): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `Notification`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install keep-awake@claude-community` from `AxGord/claude-keep-awake`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that prevents your computer from sleeping while Claude Code is working. Supports macOS (including closed-lid keep-awake on Apple Silicon), Linux, and Windows.",
